! Cargo

<<~ ahu slot=`#/definition`>>

!! Definition

Carrying, hauling, or bearing a load — the function of Floating Disc and kin.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/activation`>>

!! Activation

Establishes a bearing surface or grip that holds weight up to a capacity tied to P. Overcharge raises capacity or distance.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/interaction`>>

!! Interaction

Pairs with `domain/stuckforce` (the force that lifts) and often `hook/sustained` (the load must keep riding). A `barrier` can double as a cargo floor.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/filters`>>

!! Filters

```text
[tag[lar:///ha.ka.ba/sdm/components/function/cargo]]                          all cargo modules
[tag[lar:///ha.ka.ba/sdm/components/function/cargo]tag[lar:///ha.ka.ba/sdm/components/domain/stuckforce]]  stuckforce hauling
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/aftermath`>>

!! Aftermath

* Capacity-vs-P curve is a table-tuning question; leave numeric in the module, not here.

<<~/ahu>>

